<!-- [AI修改] 检测到在用 Claude 但未安装或未登录 Claude Code 时询问一次：安装并登录 / 以后再说 / 不再提示。 -->
<Window x:Class="CodeXPedal.Windows.App.Views.ClaudeSetupWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="CodeXPedal"
        Width="440"
        SizeToContent="Height"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterScreen"
        ResizeMode="NoResize"
        ShowInTaskbar="True"
        Topmost="True"
        Background="#141B23">
    <StackPanel Margin="24">
        <TextBlock x:Name="TitleText" FontSize="18" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
        <TextBlock x:Name="BodyText" Margin="0,12,0,0" FontSize="12" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="{StaticResource SecondaryTextBrush}" LineHeight="20" />
        <StackPanel Margin="0,22,0,0" Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
            <Button Content="不再提示" Click="NeverButton_Click" Margin="0,0,8,0" MinWidth="80" />
            <Button Content="以后再说" Click="LaterButton_Click" Margin="0,0,8,0" MinWidth="80" />
            <Button x:Name="InstallButton" Click="InstallButton_Click" MinWidth="110" Background="#315C8B" IsDefault="True" />
        </StackPanel>
    </StackPanel>
</Window>
